---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Our Factory | Nodix Solar PV Tools" description="Nodix factory-backed manufacturing for solar PV installation tools, OEM programs and B2B supply.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="kicker">NODIX / OUR FACTORY</div>
    <h1>Built around<br/><em>real manufacturing.</em></h1>
    <p>Nodix is focused on solar PV installation tools and supported by dedicated manufacturing capabilities in China. Our approach combines direct product development, factory production and responsive B2B supply.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section factory-metrics" style="padding-top:20px">
    <div class="metric-grid">
      <div class="metric"><span>01</span><strong>1,500</strong><small>SQUARE METERS</small></div>
      <div class="metric"><span>02</span><strong>74</strong><small>TEAM MEMBERS</small></div>
      <div class="metric"><span>03</span><strong>34</strong><small>PRODUCTION MACHINES</small></div>
      <div class="metric"><span>04</span><strong>100+</strong><small>NEW PRODUCTS / YEAR</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="split">
      <div class="dark-panel">
        <div class="kicker">01 / MANUFACTURING</div>
        <h3>Factory-backed<br/>product supply.</h3>
        <p>We work from real production capabilities rather than assembling an unrelated trading catalog. Product specifications, production details and quality documentation are confirmed at factory level.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dark-panel">
        <div class="kicker">02 / PRODUCT FOCUS</div>
        <h3>One field.<br/>One clear range.</h3>
        <p>Our initial focus is solar PV installation tools — cable preparation, connector handling and practical field tool combinations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>From factory<br/>to field.</h2><p>The goal is simple: make it easier for distributors, installers and professional buyers to source practical PV tools from China.</p></div>
    <div class="workflow-grid">
      <div class="step"><b>01</b><h3>PRODUCT</h3><p>Focused PV tools designed around real installation tasks.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>02</b><h3>PRODUCTION</h3><p>Factory production with product-level specification and quality control.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>03</b><h3>SUPPLY</h3><p>Flexible B2B quantities, packaging and sourcing discussions.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>04</b><h3>GLOBAL</h3><p>Supporting distributors, installers and professional buyers in international markets.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Built for<br/>global supply.</h2><p>Established in 2021, the factory supports international customers with focused production, product development and export-oriented supply.</p></div>
    <div class="split">
      <div class="dark-panel"><div class="kicker">QUALITY & COMPLIANCE</div><h3>Documented.<br/>Product by product.</h3><p>Current factory documentation includes CE, VOC and UKCA-related credentials. Product pages will show the specific documentation applicable to each item as the technical files are organized.</p><div class="cert-row"><span>CE</span><span>VOC</span><span>UKCA</span></div></div>
      <div class="dark-panel"><div class="kicker">PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT</div><h3>100+ new products<br/>developed each year.</h3><p>Product development is part of the manufacturing capability, allowing the range to evolve around customer requirements, applications and new tool combinations.</p><div class="cert-row"><span>2 PATENTS</span><span>OEM</span><span>PRIVATE LABEL</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="split" style="margin-top:14px">
      <div class="dark-panel"><div class="kicker">GLOBAL MARKET</div><h3>International<br/>export experience.</h3><p>The factory serves international markets and can support export-oriented packaging, documentation and product requirements.</p></div>
      <div class="dark-panel"><div class="kicker">QUALITY & DOCUMENTATION</div><h3>Evidence before claims.</h3><p>As factory documentation is organized, product pages will be expanded with verified specifications, applicable certificates, test documents and quality information.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dark-panel factory-oem">
      <div class="kicker">OEM / PRIVATE LABEL</div><h3>Your brand.<br/>Our production capability.</h3><p>For distributor programs and private-label projects, we can discuss product selection, logo application, packaging and tool combinations around your target market.</p><a class="btn primary" href="/contact">Discuss Your Requirement ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="cta-band"><div class="cta-inner"><h2>Looking for a factory-backed PV tool supplier?</h2><a class="btn" href="/contact">Request a Quote ↗</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
